# Forbidden Rules

## Coding
- Never use print() for debugging in committed code.
- Do not leave commented-out dead code.
- Do not expose untyped public functions.

## Testing
- Do not weaken assertions to force tests passing.
- Do not delete failing tests to make pipeline green.
- Do not skip tests without explicit reason and ticket.

## Process
- Do not bypass TDD sequence.
- Do not change behavior in refactor-only steps.
